; Prefix keys typed between C-. and the action's key give the action its
; prefix argument; C-u before C-. still keeps the read, and the prefix
; reaches no later command.
> (commands:define-command (show-prefix [b (buffer-picker:read-buffer "Buffer: ")])
    "Says the prefix argument and B's name."
